  "updated_at": "2026-03-20",
  "bio": "Juan Maveryck is a remarkably skilled tattoo artist based in Nezahualcóyotl, Mexico, who specializes in the watercolor style, bringing a vibrant and fluid artistry to each unique piece. His place is known for maintaining impeccable cleanliness, ensuring a sterile environment that provides peace of mind and safety for his clients. Whether you're seeking a splash of color or a delicate design, Juan's mastery of the watercolor technique makes him the go-to artist for anyone desiring a tattoo that is both beautiful and expertly crafted.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Nezahualcóyotl, Mexico, Mexico"
}